nv-codec-headers 12.2.72.0 (https://git.videolan.org/?p=ffmpeg/nv-codec-headers.git,
tag n12.2.72.0), the include/ffnvcodec headers copied unmodified: the NVENC
API definitions (nvEncodeAPI.h, NVIDIA, MIT) and FFmpeg's dlopen() loader
for libcuda/libnvidia-encode (dynlink_*.h, MIT). See COPYING (Ubuntu's
libffmpeg-nvenc-dev copyright file, from when 12.1 was vendored). Vendored
so the NVENC backend builds without an NVIDIA SDK or driver installed; the
driver it runs against must support NVENC API 12.2 (550.54 or newer on
Linux).
